    {
      "id": "claim_e21385fa05bf4b4ea9aa3a17f2353c83",
      "statement": "The start-and-wait path does not use ResultController: AbstractController.handleRunPipelineAndWaitForResult calls runPipeline first and, only when that returns an empty Optional, calls ResultService.waitForResult; a timeout yields 202 Accepted with REQUEST_TIMED_OUT_START_AND_WAIT, directing the client to poll get-result with the ID it already holds.",
