    {
      "id": "claim_0f773ca5fc9a4e9eb44549811d919a6c",
      "statement": "The custom TimeoutException is mapped by GlobalExceptionHandler to 408 Request Timeout but is never constructed in the current code; the real wait path catches java.util.concurrent.TimeoutException inside waitForResultHelper and returns Optional.empty(), so an expired wait observably yields 202 Accepted, never 408 — the 408 handler is a defensive path for the TimeoutException declared in several controller signatures.",
