    {
      "id": "claim_ced188e53bec48d18cd493a8eba6eb2d",
      "statement": "Retrieval behavior is pinned by integration tests against a live Redis container: AbstractTLRControllerTest.testRetrievingResultForInvalidId asserts 422 for unknown IDs on both retrieval endpoints; waitForResultUntilReady_test loops wait-for-result asserting the 202/REQUEST_TIMED_OUT pairing until 200/RESULT_IS_READY; tryGetResultWhenNotReady_test asserts 202/RESULT_NOT_READY; and testUtil.TestUtils pins the exact status/message/result combinations, so changing a ResultMessages constant or status pairing breaks the build.",
